      <h3 id="registry-configuring-storage-vsphere_configuring-registry-storage-vsphere" class="group scroll-mt-20">Configuring registry storage for VMware vSphere<a href="#registry-configuring-storage-vsphere_configuring-registry-storage-vsphere" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p class="_abstract">As a cluster administrator, following installation you must configure your registry to use storage.</p>
      <p><strong>Prerequisites</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>Cluster administrator permissions.</li>
